<section class="flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen px-4 py-12 bg-background-navy md:px-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-full h-full gap-8 content-container lg:flex-row">
    <div class="w-full space-y-6 text-center lg:w-full lg:text-left">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">The product development partner for <strong class="text-secondary">early-stage Canadian startups</strong></h1>
      <p class="text-base text-white sm:text-lg">We help founders ship their MVP, validate faster, and scale their product — without building a full in-house engineering team. From idea to production, we move at startup speed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-center w-full">
      <%= image_tag("icons/swoosh.svg", class: "") %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 py-16 bg-background-black md:px-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center content-container">
    <div class="mb-16 pill">
      <p class="">Who we work best with</p>
    </div>

    <div class="w-full mb-16 text-center">
      <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-base text-white sm:text-lg">We partner with early-stage startups that are ready to move fast. If you're building a product and need a technical partner — not just a vendor — you're in the right place.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 mt-8">
        <span class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white rounded-full bg-white/10">Pre-seed to Series A</span>
        <span class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white rounded-full bg-white/10">1–10 employees</span>
        <span class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white rounded-full bg-white/10">Founder-led teams</span>
        <span class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white rounded-full bg-white/10">MVP stage companies</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid w-full grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="p-8 rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <h3 class="mb-4">Builder Founder</h3>
        <p class="mb-6 text-white/80">You have the vision but need someone to build it. You're non-technical or semi-technical, under pressure to show traction, and need a trusted technical partner — not a dev shop that disappears after delivery.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-white/70">
          <li>→ MVP development from scratch</li>
          <li>→ Product validation & iteration</li>
          <li>→ Replace manual workflows with software</li>
          <li>→ Build your SaaS product</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <h3 class="mb-4">Overloaded Technical Founder</h3>
        <p class="mb-6 text-white/80">You're writing most of the code yourself. You need capacity, architecture guidance, and a team that can ship — so you can focus on the business instead of being stuck in the codebase.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-white/70">
          <li>→ Refactor and clean up your prototype</li>
          <li>→ Extend your engineering capacity</li>
          <li>→ Ship features faster</li>
          <li>→ Add AI or third-party integrations</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 py-16 bg-background-navy md:px-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center content-container">
    <div class="mb-16 pill">
      <p class="">What we stand for</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col items-start md:flex-row md:justify-between md:gap-16">
      <div class="w-full mb-8 md:w-1/2 md:mb-0">
        <%= image_tag("Josiah-March2024-8-M.jpg", class: "rounded-xl shadow-lg w-full h-auto") %>
      </div>

      <div class="w-full space-y-10 md:w-1/2">
        <div class="text-center md:text-left">
          <h3 class="">Founder-First Partnership</h3>
          <p class="">Your traction milestones drive our roadmap. We work as an extension of your founding team — listening before we build, adapting as your product evolves, and making every technical decision with your growth stage in mind. We succeed when you do.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center md:text-left">
          <h3 class="">Ship Fast, Validate First</h3>
          <p class="">We build what your users need to validate your idea — not what looks impressive in a demo. Every feature is scoped around learning and traction. We help you get to your first users, first revenue, and first signal as quickly as possible — then scale from there.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-center md:text-left">
          <h3 class="">Runway-Conscious Development</h3>
          <p class="">We treat your runway like it’s ours. We scope to what delivers the most value, cut what doesn’t, and give you predictable estimates grounded in real startup experience. No surprise invoices, no scope creep — just transparent execution built around your budget.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 py-10 bg-background-black md:px-8">
  <div class="content-container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="p-6 text-center rounded-xl bg-white/5">
        <p class="mb-1 text-3xl font-bold text-secondary">7+</p>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-white">Years Experience</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-white/60">Senior engineering, not junior outsourcing</p>
